job, the easier the search.Â  
JOB SEARCH 102: WHAT THEY DID NOT TEACH YOU IN
101 is your link to a new job.Â  Â 
There is much more!Â 
Find out why you are having a hard time finding a job and 
learn how to get the job you have been looking for.Â  This e-book will give you a 
genuine edge in todayÃ¿FFFF92s competitive job market.Â  You will get tons of practical 
